[ti:Paisa Sanak]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai, nahi ab inme baaki namak. Har samaya sirf paisa dekhen, chadhi hai inhe sanak.
[00:13.07]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai
[00:18.14]Nahi ab inme baaki namak
[00:23.21]Har samaya sirf paisa dekhen
[00:28.28]Chadhi hai inhe sanak
[00:33.35]Eh eh sanak
[00:38.42]Ole ole sanak
[00:43.49]Mati ka ghat, bech dara thode daam par
[00:48.56]Jo tinke bin ud jai, ohi ko kahen udand
[00:53.63]Saach bolat jo jare man, tinka dara jaam par
[00:58.70]Kabira na ro, sab samne hai
[01:03.77]Nahi ab inme baaki namak
[01:08.84]Sang baithe sab baniye bane, meet sabai bikaau bhaye
[01:13.91]Hari ka naam jo bikai nahi, taako bolat nahi jiye
[01:18.98]Aankhin dekhat loot ho rahi, bhesaj bana re kaal
[01:24.05]Je paisa bin kachhu na karai, tinka karau na haal
[01:29.12]Kabira, ab kahe rowe? Jo khoi go so kaagad tha
[01:34.19]Jo miligo so dhaaga
[01:39.26]Inhi ke sang marihai sab, tu kyun bana re aaga
[01:44.33]Kahe Kabir... paisa aaj ujaar karai... kal maati mein hoti.
